program	no_hidden_alloc_panic_interpolation.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	string interpolation allocates a String — `--no-hidden-alloc` forbids allocations the source does not name
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: string interpolation allocates a String — `--no-hidden-alloc` forbids allocations the source does not name"
log	"  --> examples/no_hidden_alloc_panic_interpolation.saw:15:15"
log	"     |"
log	" 15 |         panic(\"out of frames: {remaining} left\")"
log	"     |               ^"
log	"   hint: pass the values as format arguments instead — `print(\"x = {}\", x)`, `panic(\"out of {}\", what)` — or assemble the text in a fixed-capacity `StringBuilder`; a message with nothing interpolated into it is an interned literal and costs nothing"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
